  "expected": "H~2~O and E = mc^2^. %{background:yellow}Important%: press <kbd>Ctrl+C</kbd> then <kbd><Enter></kbd>. Area: @\\pi r^2@.\n\n!img/chart.png(Sales chart)!\np(caption). Sales by _quarter_\n\n!raw.png!\np(caption). No alt text\n"
 },
